ot lying\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Done\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>boolean</code> seguido de <code>===</code>, <code>console.log(\"He's not lying\");</code> e finalmente <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>",
