            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aumente o <code>salary</code> em 500 se for menor que 2100. Exiba o <code>salary</code> no final da função.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displaySalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &lt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary + \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(salary);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displaySalary(\" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"104\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2500\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>salary = salary + 500;</code> seguido de <code>console.log(salary);</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um salário abaixo de <code>2100</code> recebe um aumento de <code>500</code>. Comece com <code>2000</code> para exibir <code>2500</code> após o aumento.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"displaySalary\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"salary\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (salary &lt; \" /><text value=\"2100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  salary = salary + \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(salary);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"displaySalary(\" /><text value=\"2000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"salary = 500;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2500\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2500\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;</code> seguido de <code>2100</code>, <code>salary = salary + 500;</code> e finalmente <code>2000</code>.</p></body></html>",
